{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05265","headline":"安乐公主移入新宅侍宴应制同用开字 · 赵彦昭","name":"安乐公主移入新宅侍宴应制同用开字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云物中京晓，天人外馆开。\n飞桥象河汉，悬牓学蓬莱。\n北阙临仙槛，南山送寿杯。\n一窥轮奂毕，惭恧栋梁材。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}